c Pigeonhole Formula: PHP(2,3)
c 3 pigeons, 2 holes
c Variables: x_ij = pigeon i in hole j (i=1..3, j=1..2)
c x11, x12, x21, x22, x31, x32
c
c Constraints:
c 1. Each pigeon in at least one hole: (x_i1 ∨ x_i2) for i=1,2,3
c 2. At most one pigeon per hole: (¬x_i1 ∨ ¬x_j1) for i<j, and (¬x_i2 ∨ ¬x_j2) for i<j
c
p cnf 6 9
1 2 0
3 4 0
5 6 0
-1 -3 0
-1 -5 0
-3 -5 0
-2 -4 0
-2 -6 0
-4 -6 0
